# C++ HackerRank Solutions 🚀

[![C++](https://img.shields.io/badge/C%2B%2B-17-blue.svg)](https://isocpp.org/)
[![License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg)](LICENSE)
[![HackerRank](https://img.shields.io/badge/HackerRank-Solver-brightgreen.svg)](https://www.hackerrank.com/)

## Overview

A growing collection of professional **C++ solutions to HackerRank challenges** and problem-solving exercises. This repository is designed to build strong fundamentals in logic, algorithms, and competitive programming through consistent practice.

## Repository Goals

- Strengthen C++ basics and syntax
- Improve problem-solving and algorithmic thinking
- Practice HackerRank-style competitive coding
- Maintain clean, readable, and well-structured code
- Build a solid foundation for Data Structures & Algorithms (DSA)

## Topics Covered

- Introduction
- Basic Data Types
- Conditionals
- Loops
- Arrays
- Strings
- Functions
- Searching
- Sorting
- Recursion
- STL

## Repository Structure

```text
Competitive-Programming-CPP/
├── README.md
├── LICENSE
├── .gitignore
├── CMakeLists.txt
├── Introduction/
│   ├── README.md
│   └── HelloWorld.cpp
├── Basic-Data-Types/
├── Conditionals/
├── Loops/
├── Arrays/
├── Strings/
├── Functions/
├── Searching/
