├── STL/
└── .github/
```

## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- GCC/G++ compiler
- VS Code or any C++ editor
- Git and GitHub

### Compile and Run

```bash
g++ Introduction/HelloWorld.cpp -o hello
./hello
```

### Using CMake

```bash
mkdir build
cd build
cmake ..
make
```

## Solution Format

Each solution should follow a clean style:

```cpp
#include <bits/stdc++.h>
using namespace std;

int main() {
    // Problem solution
    return 0;
}
```

